{"title":"1997 USAMO Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(inspired_by_Solution_1)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (inspired by Solution 1)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_USAMO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Prove that, for all positive real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/0/2d02bb2275100261109b043261e702124460a83e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a, b, c,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"48\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/4/32471f871658fb625600803c8f64205cfd63f27b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{1}{a^3+b^3+abc}+\\frac{1}{b^3+c^3+abc}+\\frac{1}{a^3+c^3+abc} \\le \\frac{1}{abc}\\]\" width=\"410\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_USAMO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Because the inequality is homogenous (i.e. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/0/d80414f2f94f70731e91b6e12c4e6934c8fa65de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a, b, c)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"57\" height=\"20\" /> can be replaced with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/d/c0d1acebb81501dcecf5aa496dc1eb788edc2be7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(ka, kb, kc)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"84\" height=\"18\" /> without changing the inequality other than by a factor of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/c/67c554dfde776faf84eee88fb710170179f1b5a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k^n$\" width=\"18\" height=\"12\" /> for some <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />), without loss of generality, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/3/2e32cfd3a6f5f31f73d0b272a5f7b1638fd16551.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$abc = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"57\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p>Lemma:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/6/40699bc0defba4331f503edc329983f1d2048e7f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{1}{a^3 + b^3 + 1} \\le \\frac{c}{a + b + c}.\\]\" width=\"189\" height=\"38\" />\nProof: Rearranging gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/3/7c3036c1ad8bd7f8c66d50d1ab837a8222d2a4c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a^3 + b^3) c + c \\ge a + b + c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"200\" height=\"19\" />, which is a simple consequence of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/0/c10296a70661b42dfe103bff4ca86a958bc310a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^3 + b^3 = (a + b)(a^2 - ab + b^2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"239\" height=\"19\" /> and\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/3/d73b9c3c44c70799a4efe54c36b8834d174e99eb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(a^2 - ab + b^2)c \\ge (2ab - ab)c = abc = 1.\\]\" width=\"313\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p>Thus, by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/3/2e32cfd3a6f5f31f73d0b272a5f7b1638fd16551.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$abc = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"57\" height=\"13\" />:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/e/98ee2820cb96c8bf7f543afcbde3eabaf90751e5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{1}{a^3 + b^3 + abc} + \\frac{1}{b^3 + c^3 + abc} + \\frac{1}{c^3 + a^3 + abc}\\]\" width=\"357\" height=\"38\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/5/9658d126aac55adb471e760d4bd7def3ddb71a72.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\le \\frac{c}{a + b + c} + \\frac{a}{a + b + c} + \\frac{b}{a + b + c} = 1 = \\frac{1}{abc}.\\]\" width=\"373\" height=\"39\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_USAMO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Rearranging the AM-HM inequality, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/5/7c53cef5eba24b70e1bef66be0b20630d3c3ad34.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{x}+\\frac{1}{y}+\\frac{1}{z} \\le \\frac{9}{x+y+z}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"186\" height=\"41\" />. Letting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/7/f57c5bb2a9e4ef90fe2c454afe5323ffef7c01ad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=a^{3}+b^{3}+abc$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"137\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/1/421c3b1abf54cb41e5124ef8ee9e3fb409b386cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=b^{3}+c^{3}+abc$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"134\" height=\"18\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/2/d620123e0ccc160a47cfd499af0230a6b9cd3d31.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z=c^{3}+a^{3}+abc$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"136\" height=\"16\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/0/5802891d521ebfc5a35b2721e0ce5d6d205621e2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{1}{a^{3}+b^{3}+abc}+\\frac{1}{b^{3}+c^{3}+abc}+\\frac{1}{c^{3}+a^{3}+abc} \\le \\frac{9}{2a^{3}+2b^{3}+2c^{3}+3abc}.\\]\" width=\"550\" height=\"39\" /> By AM-GM on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/4/b24ac02e04360fc5b2f93f6318cab26159832ce8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{3}$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/8/b384e0448d0a8e2fe2e54ffab713d2f28ec8449a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b^{3}$\" width=\"14\" height=\"15\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/8/4a85fe759d46244ca0665c94f43d9f85f847fbff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c^{3}$\" width=\"14\" height=\"15\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/4/7e4ccdc00fb116bbd35579093d54b1b16a6c554f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a^{3}+b^{3}+c^{3} \\ge 3abc \\Rightarrow 2a^{3}+2b^{3}+2c^{3}+3abc \\ge 9abc \\Rightarrow \\frac{9}{2a^{3}+2b^{3}+2c^{3}+3abc} \\le \\frac{1}{abc}.\\]\" width=\"638\" height=\"39\" /> So, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/c/f5c2b81742c197f0ee1f090c1d4dc482b0cd5428.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{a^{3}+b^{3}+abc}+\\frac{1}{b^{3}+c^{3}+abc}+\\frac{1}{c^{3}+a^{3}+abc} \\le \\frac{1}{abc}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"412\" height=\"38\" />.\n-Tigerzhang\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/5/545c72e3cb06831a6ef4e385eb9898d33bb6087e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{WARNING:}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"102\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p>This solution doesn’t work because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/2/782d6e1d188c0ccc55fcf4f629a54bc0e16bc77e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x+y+z)\\left(\\frac{1}{x}+\\frac{1}{y}+\\frac{1}{z}\\right)\\geq 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"238\" height=\"45\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/0/2e0b315f825a2e0fc89b7e8fa1d938c459da086d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{x}+\\frac{1}{y}+\\frac{1}{z}\\geq \\frac{9}{x+y+z}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"189\" height=\"42\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_USAMO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If we multiply each side by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96a81938ca5e71faa6894d9d52ac776c9efbe75d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$abc$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"27\" height=\"14\" />, we get that we must just prove that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/4/3941571a34486320f956fcf94c5f776d5ff63a9c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{abc}{a^3+b^3+abc} + \\frac{abc}{b^3+c^3+abc} + \\frac{abc}{c^3+a^3+abc} \\leq 1\\]\" width=\"391\" height=\"39\" /> If we divide our LHS equation, we get that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/b/fdb96a5afe575c18d6342deef9d0b591b14cfcae.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{1}{\\frac{a^3+b^3+abc}{abc}} +\\frac{1}{\\frac{b^3+c^3+abc}{abc}} + \\frac{1}{\\frac{c^3+a^3+abc}{abc}}\\]\" width=\"259\" height=\"44\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/0/0d067e90da78b56d725a528ee7ee8fa175cb675d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[= \\frac{1}{\\frac{a^2}{bc} + \\frac{b^2}{ac} + 1} +\\frac{1}{\\frac{b^2}{ac} + \\frac{c^2}{ab} + 1}  + \\frac{1}{\\frac{c^2}{ab} + \\frac{a^2}{bc} + 1}\\]\" width=\"337\" height=\"44\" /> Make the astute observation that by Titu's Lemma, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/3/ea30a01c594c7b9fd495f51385265db7025e143e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{a^2}{bc} + \\frac{b^2}{ac} \\geq \\frac{\\left(a+b\\right)^2}{bc+ ac}\\]\" width=\"150\" height=\"44\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/7/797d01ba992e112e82550ac2c26067ce761c8955.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sum_{cyc}\\frac{\\left(a+b\\right)^2}{bc+ ac} \\leq \\sum_{cyc}\\frac{a^2}{bc} + \\frac{b^2}{ac}\\]\" width=\"209\" height=\"52\" /> Therefore: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/d/49d1ee9de1fe9bf2dead81a77cbfcc8b490550b1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sum_{cyc} \\frac{1}{\\frac{\\left(a+b\\right)^2}{c\\left(a+b\\right)  }+1} \\geq \\sum_{cyc} \\frac{1}{\\frac{a^2}{bc} + \\frac{b^2}{ac} + 1}\\]\" width=\"251\" height=\"50\" /> If we expand it out, we get that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/d/afd89247d8f1235f2e467656eaeb03557bed6f7d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sum_{cyc} \\frac{1}{\\frac{\\left(a+b\\right)^2}{c\\left(a+b\\right)  }+1}  = \\frac{a+b+c}{a+b+c} = 1\\]\" width=\"237\" height=\"50\" /> Since our original equation is less than this, we get that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/7/e87129d2dd14eba242c0261f06e09c505d1a5c93.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sum_{cyc} \\frac{1}{\\frac{a^2}{bc} + \\frac{b^2}{ac} + 1} \\leq 1\\]\" width=\"152\" height=\"47\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/b/10bc2e55ce8d956cb131aebfea447c2d373770ff.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sum_{cyc} \\frac{abc}{a^3+b^3+abc}\\leq 1\\]\" width=\"166\" height=\"48\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/d/92d5e335d006689d3e32f07c9702b5791e6d599c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sum_{cyc} \\frac{1}{a^3+b^3+abc} \\leq \\frac{1}{abc}\\]\" width=\"186\" height=\"47\" />\n</p><p>-KEVIN_LIU\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28inspired_by_Solution_1.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(inspired_by_Solution_1)\">Video Solution (inspired by Solution 1)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_USAMO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (inspired by Solution 1)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/6czJm7FMGtk\">https://youtu.be/6czJm7FMGtk</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_USAMO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:40%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_USAMO\" title=\"1997 USAMO\">1997 USAMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_USAMO_Problems\" title=\"1997 USAMO Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=27&amp;year=1997\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_USAMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1997 USAMO Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_USAMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1997 USAMO Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_USAMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1997 USAMO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_USAMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1997 USAMO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_USAMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1997 USAMO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_USAMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1997 USAMO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_USAMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1997 USAMO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=USAMO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"USAMO Problems and Solutions\"> All USAMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017190915\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.038 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.060 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 242/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1313/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 48/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 7973/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   14.347      1 -total\n 57.90%    8.307      1 Template:USAMO_newbox\n 39.85%    5.718      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:9712:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017190915 and revision id 238235. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}